    "detailed_description": "<strong>Neon Beats</strong> is a 2D side view <strong>platformer game</strong> in which the player will evolve in different levels that are <strong>rhythmed by catchy musics</strong>. <br><br><strong>Complete</strong> levels as quickly as possible!<br><strong>Gather</strong> several hidden collectibles!<br><strong>Brave</strong> different challenging obstacles!<br><br>In <strong>Neon Beats</strong>, you will find :<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 different levels with it's own music<br></li><li>Rhythm based gameplay<br></li><li>A character with smooth and responsive controls<br></li><li>Simple and elegant neon ambiance <br></li><li>Several challenging level elements<br></li><li>Hidden collectibles adding instruments to the music<br></li><li>A score system based on your time, collectibles and deaths</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Neon Beats</strong> is a 2D side view <strong>platformer game</strong> in which the player will evolve in different levels that are <strong>rhythmed by catchy musics</strong>. <br><br><strong>Complete</strong> levels as quickly as possible!<br><strong>Gather</strong> several hidden collectibles!<br><strong>Brave</strong> different challenging obstacles!<br><br>In <strong>Neon Beats</strong>, you will find :<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 different levels with it's own music<br></li><li>Rhythm based gameplay<br></li><li>A character with smooth and responsive controls<br></li><li>Simple and elegant neon ambiance <br></li><li>Several challenging level elements<br></li><li>Hidden collectibles adding instruments to the music<br></li><li>A score system based on your time, collectibles and deaths</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Beat your best scores in Neon Beats, a 2D platformer game with rhythm based levels!",
